  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "His arrival is announced at Ice Crystal grotto-heaven’s second meeting, together with Golden Fur Immortal Monarch, Blitz Cloud Heavenly Immortal, and Great Wisdom Immortal Mother. Many rank eight variant human experts come. This is the first time these four have attended. Wu Shuai sits on the main seat and takes the alliance leader position.",
      "chapters": [
        1981
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ice_crystal_grotto_heaven",
        "char_golden_fur_immortal_monarch",
        "char_great_wisdom_immortal_mother",
        "char_wu_shuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a miniman. His entire body is covered in a green light.",
      "chapters": [
        1981
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Xia clan headquarters, over ten variant human Gu Immortals stand in a standoff. Xiao He Jian leads him and Great Wisdom Immortal Mother on one side, against Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch’s group. He is also a miniman like Xiao He Jian, so he has a natural closeness to him. With those two supporting Xiao He Jian, Xiao He Jian can barely contend. When Wu Shuai and Fang Yuan arrive, Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch and Xiao He Jian take the lead in kneeling.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xia-clan-headquarters",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_xiao_he_jian",
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the resources Fang Yuan sorts from the two heavens’ grotto-heavens, wood path immortal materials are most abundant. He and Xiao He Jian are minimen, and besides them there are also two wood path grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2073
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wood-path-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has subdued the variant human alliance. Two miniman Gu Immortals fly out of the palace: Xiao He Jian and Green Forest Great Sage. Under Wu Shuai’s persuasion they offer wood path Immortal Gu. He transmits in anger that forest Gu is the core of many of his killer moves, and that he has lost almost all his battle strength without it. Xiao He Jian answers that Green Forest Great Sage only lost rank seven forest Gu, while Xiao He Jian had to offer rank eight Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "forced-immortal-gu-offering",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the contribution board Xiao He Jian stands first, his contribution points in four digits. Green Forest Great Sage is not among the top three, but he is in the top ten. He becomes slightly happier and tells Xiao He Jian that the alliance leader remembered their contribution.",
      "chapters": [
        2074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "forced-immortal-gu-offering",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Xiao He Jian are rank eight miniman Gu Immortals of the variant human alliance. Their grotto-heavens are wood path grotto-heavens, which provide wood path immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        2081
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wood-path-grotto-heavens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave’s eighth layer, Xiao He Jian fights Nie Kuang Feng. At the crucial moment two figures appear beside Xiao He Jian: Green Forest Great Sage, a miniman Gu Immortal, and Black Locust, owner of Giant Locust grotto-heaven and another wood path cultivator. The three wood path Gu Immortals cooperate. Flying leaf blades turn into seeds planted on Nie Kuang Feng, and vines grow and bind it.",
      "chapters": [
        2172
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighth-layer",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_nie_kuang_feng",
        "race_minimen",
        "char_black_locust",
        "loc_giant_locust_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nie Kuang Feng demonizes into a reddish brown demonic wind. Intense winds cross several thousand steps and arrive before Green Forest Great Sage. He has already used his defensive killer move, but after the wind devours him, his aura quickly weakens, and he dies after a few breaths of time.",
      "chapters": [
        2173
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
